('','Here is a beacon for you, $n.  You must keep it in your possession if you are to find the corrupted items we will need.',5244,1,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,25,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Here is a beacon for you, $n.  You must keep it in your possession if you are to find the corrupted items we will need.',5245,7,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,25,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
