('Yesh, it\'sh true, I\'m blind as a bat! An\' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.$B$BI\'ll tell you what, $r. It\'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It\'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days.','',9798,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,1,33,5,10,50,100,54630),
