('Greetings, $c - I\'m a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service.\n','Greetings, $c - I\'m a Commendation Officer acting on behalf of Darnassus.  It is my duty to assist adventurers who have received Alliance Commendation Signets.$B$BI accept signets in different quantities, but the most beneficial exchange for you is to hand in a set of ten at once.  I will enter your deeds into our records when you hand in your signets.  As a result, you will earn recognition from Darnassus for your duty and service.\n\n',11415,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,66,1,0,0,0,0,54630),
