('You can see me? Do you know how much I\'m ignored up here just because no one can see me? How refreshing to finally have someone to talk to!$B$BSo, you must have been sent by some living member of my former mercenary company, am I right? Of course I am!$B$BBut enough idle chit-chat, there\'s a great deal of work for you and I if you\'re going to put things right and return Lord Valthalak\'s spirit to him!','',11772,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,1,1,0,0,1000,0,54630),
