('It is here that Gul\'dan severed the tie between orcs and the elemental spirits. His unquenchable thirst for power could not be satiated with the complete annihilation of the draenei. He had to also destroy Draenor, razing the land and siphoning all of its energies for use in his war.$B$BNow all that is left are remnants of his madness.$B$BLook to the altar, $r - the land is forever haunted...','',18736,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,1,1,25,0,0,0,54630),
