('You\'re like something of a revered figure around here, $g man : kitten;.  Seems like everyone\'s talking about you.  That\'s cool.$B$BLet\'s see if there\'s something in stock that you\'re interested in.  We have a lot of nice stuff.','',21643,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,25,1,0,0,0,0,54630),
