('Ya know, without so many of them burly trolls wanderin\' about this place can be downright pleasant.','',23212,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I wonder if I\'ll ever be the same after this. Heh, nuthin\' a pint won\'t cure I\'ll wager.','',23213,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Quite an adventure, this. The boys back home won\'t believe a word of it....','',23214,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I oughtta shuffle on down and poke around fer treasure while I\'m here - after all, what\'re the odds of a dwarf like me gettin\' pinched twice?','',23215,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('That rescue came just in time. Ya shoulda seen what them brutes did to their prisoners....','',23216,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('This\'ll make fer a great a story to tell the grandkids, that\'s fer sure... if I be livin\' long enough to have any, that is.','',23217,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
