('','Day in and day out all Mad Jonah Sterling wants me to do is swab the decks.$B$BSwab the decks?!$B$BI\'m a mage, I don\'t DO swabbin\'! At least not the mundane way.',23814,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
