('The fruit vendor has refused to accept my challenge and remove his cart.  Their ogre protector just sits and does nothing... What could his plan be?','The fruit vendor has refused to accept my challenge and remove his cart.  Their ogre protector just sits and does nothing... What could his plan be?',27704,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,6,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('We should sell these apples, but we will not allow peole to eat them.  Oh no!  We will sell apples to our friends, and they shall bring the fight to the fruit vendor for me!','We should sell these apples, but we will not allow peole to eat them.  Oh no!  We will sell apples to our friends, and they shall bring the fight to the fruit vendor for me!',27705,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,6,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('My army has not arrived.  I knew I could not trust the people I hired.  We will recruit new people.  We will sell these apples and our new army will crush them!','My army has not arrived.  I knew I could not trust the people I hired.  We will recruit new people.  We will sell these apples and our new army will crush them!',27706,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,6,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('It\'s time to deal with this fruit situtation on our terms.  We\'ve been far too accomidating to the fruit vendor.  Now we will simply sell the fruit.  But the fruit will not be for people to eat.  I forbid it!  No one will eat our fruit!','It\'s time to deal with this fruit situtation on our terms.  We\'ve been far too accomidating to the fruit vendor.  Now we will simply sell the fruit.  But the fruit will not be for people to eat.  I forbid it!  No one will eat our fruit!',27707,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,15,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
