('','When we were packed into the Town-In-A-Box, they told us we\'d be deployed somewhere in Azshara. Is this Azshara?$B$BI ask you: who prepares a Town-In-A-Box and doesn\'t supply it with enough food to live on?! One measly Poultryizer?!$B$BWe all know how the \"Micro\" Mechachicken worked out.',37854,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,6,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
