('','$n, the Twilight slaves you and others have been rescuing from Wolf\'s Run are wandering into camp, but they can\'t tell me who they are and they speak in riddles and gibberish.$B$BI thought Twilight\'s Hammer kept the slaves in line the old fashioned way - you know, whips and chains - but it\'s clear that there\'s some brainwashing at work...\n',39727,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,1,6,0,0,0,0,54630),
