('There\'s another destroyed. Maintain the assault!','',39857,0,0,5,65,0,0,17543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Excellent work. Don\'t let up!','',39858,0,0,4,65,0,0,17544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
