('Relish this victory, mortals, for it will be your last. This world will burn with the master\'s return!','',40065,0,0,0,65,0,0,17503,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Another \"hero\" falls.','',40066,0,0,0,65,0,0,17501,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
