('You fool! I ain\'t runnin\' away. I lured ya here, ta kill ya wit\' your own precious tribe!','',40119,1,0,1,65,0,0,17599,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('No matter! I can\'t be touched. No living ting can make its way trough dis barrier! Da Echo Isles be Zalazane\'s ta rule, shadow hunter! Now, and FOREVER!','',40120,1,0,0,65,0,0,17600,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
