('YOU!$B$BYou think you can just waltz in here and take my spot? Think again, $g boy : girl;!$B$BI\'ve heard the whispering in the boardroom. The people you\'ve surrounded yourself with at headquarters are all boot-licking sycophants who will do anything to get ahead. I should know... I hired all of them.$B$BYour meteoric rise to power is a fluke, and I\'m fully prepared to knock you down a gear or two! Watch your step, $n. Who knows when you\'re going to need me on your side?','',40209,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,5,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
