('','The Black dragonkin materialized from thin air, and set upon us before we could react.',40601,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,17493,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','We did not stand a chance. As my brethren perished around me, I managed to retreat here and bar the entrance.',40602,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,17494,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','They slaughtered us with cold efficiency, but the true focus of their interest seemed to be the eggs kept here in the Sanctum.',40603,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,17495,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
