('Aye. I was here when the dragon attacked.','',41901,0,0,396,65,0,0,21353,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('He could\'ve destroyed the entire city if he willed it. We were powerless to stop him.','',41902,0,0,1,65,0,0,22801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('What drove him off, then?','',41903,0,0,6,65,0,0,21352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
