('Slaughter them all! Show no mercy, brothers!','',43346,0,0,0,65,0,0,21854,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('The only peace you shall find is in death, Kvaldir!','',43347,0,0,0,65,0,0,21853,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
