('Since the fall of Grim Batol, we Wildhammers have never truly been united. Out here in the Highlands, forgotten by the rest of the world, the different clans have all gone their separate ways.$B$BTo join them all back together isn\'t going to be easy. ','',48607,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,1,274,0,0,0,0,54630),
