('BOOO!  Did I scare you?$b$bHallow\'s End is all about two things, tricks and treats!  Some adults think it\'s more.  They tried to tell me, but I got bored, until things got set on fire.  That was cool!$b$bBut still, even fire can get boring.  I can tell you what doesn\'t get boring... Tricking people and eating candy!$b$bBut I only want one kind of candy, Candy Coins!  They are the best.  They look like real gold coins!  Also, if you have too many coins, you can eat them!  It\'s like being rich and eating your money!  It\'s crazy!$b$bSo... Do you have some coins you want to trade?','BOOO!  Did I scare you?$b$bHallow\'s End is all about two things, tricks and treats!  Some adults think it\'s more.  They tried to tell me, but I got bored, until things got set on fire.  That was cool!$b$bBut still, even fire can get boring.  I can tell you what doesn\'t get boring... Tricking people and eating candy!$b$bBut I only want one kind of candy, Candy Coins!  They are the best.  They look like real gold coins!  Also, if you have too many coins, you can eat them!  It\'s like being rich and eating your money!  It\'s crazy!$b$bSo... Do you have some coins you want to trade?',51299,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,396,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
