('','Never you mind, $r. The details of my past were burned away when I joined the Druids of the Flame. They are of no concern to you.$b$bBesides, I am here to discuss the future of this realm. And I do not plan to discuss it with you.$b$bNow answer me... where is Malfurion!?',51764,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,1,5,0,0,0,0,54630),
