('Coward! You cannot run!','',51914,0,0,0,65,0,0,24241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('No! You do not escape the rage of the Gurubashi!','',51915,0,0,0,65,0,0,24242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Gri\'lek wanders... no more...','',51916,0,0,0,65,0,0,24233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Today, you\'ll wish you never stirred from your bed!','',51917,0,0,0,64,0,0,24247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
