('There there... close your eyes...','',51919,0,0,0,64,0,0,24253,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Let us see what horrors stir within your nightmares!','',51920,0,0,0,64,0,0,24249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Let\'s see what\'s more horrifying... to dream unwaking, or to awaken in a living nightmare!','',51921,0,0,0,64,0,0,24250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
