('My spirit dreams no longer...','',51923,0,0,0,64,0,0,24248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Finally, Tarecgosa, our beloved sister whose essence you have generously borne, has chosen this staff as her permanent home.','',51924,0,0,485,65,0,0,24879,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Ahhh... I shall add a new blade to my collection today...','',51925,0,0,0,65,0,0,24309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('A swift slice to the throat, and this one falls like any other.','',51926,0,0,0,65,0,0,24311,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Learn your place.','',51927,0,0,0,65,0,0,24312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Perhaps a quick stab will let out all that tension in your shoulders...','',51928,0,0,0,65,0,0,24314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Rogues do it from behind...','',51929,0,0,0,65,0,0,24315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('It only hurts this much the first time.  The second time, you\'re dead.','',51930,0,0,0,65,0,0,24316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
