('What? You\'ve come to laugh at Zanzil, too? Not again! I\'ll make you pay!','What? You\'ve come to laugh at Zanzil, too? Not again! I\'ll make you pay!',51935,0,0,0,65,0,0,24337,24337,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
