('How does that taste?','How does that taste?',51937,0,0,0,65,0,0,24343,24343,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Oooh, pretty... Zanzil\'s got big plans for this one...','Oooh, pretty... Zanzil\'s got big plans for this one...',51938,0,0,0,65,0,0,24344,24344,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
