('','Go\'el, it\'s me - Aggra! Don\'t you know me?',52102,0,0,5,65,0,0,0,24683,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Oblivion... nothing... but oblivion...','',52103,0,0,0,65,0,0,24748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','He\'s too far gone! We have to keep trying!',52104,0,0,22,65,0,0,0,24684,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
