('','Look there - a vision within the torrent! Is this what Go\'el longed for most? Peace with his enemies - an end to the constant warring of his world?',52189,0,0,25,65,0,0,0,24728,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','He... wished to lay down his weapon... and the burdens of leadership...',52190,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,24729,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Another vision! I see Go\'el, but... it... it\'s me. Was I his deepest desire? A mate with which to share his life... his burdens and his joys?',52191,0,0,25,65,0,0,0,24730,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','A final vision! Ancestors... could those be... our children? This was his deepest desire... to be a father?',52192,0,0,6,65,0,0,0,24732,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','...to have a family of his own... with me? Go\'el never knew his parents... It was only a few years ago that he even found his people... I should have known this was what he wanted most.',52193,0,0,274,65,0,0,0,24733,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Ancestors, give me strength! The vortex\'s pull is increasing! It\'s pulling me in! The power of his longing... it\'s overwhelming!',52194,0,0,430,65,0,0,0,24735,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
