('I release you from this fate Leyara. May you finally find your peace in death.','',52689,0,0,1,65,0,0,24848,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I\'m sorry that I did not arrive sooner, though you seem to have held your own quite well.','',52690,0,0,1,65,0,0,24849,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('We\'ll meet you back in camp.','',52691,0,0,1,65,0,0,24850,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Leyara, you must see that Fandral is beyond redemption. The corruption within him runs deeper than you know.','',52692,0,0,1,65,0,0,24946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
