('No, NO! I didn\'t \"betray\" the dragonflights. We were all betrayed. Ysera was lost in a dream while this whole world came undone.','',52825,0,0,0,65,0,0,24440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I enact my master\'s will! I am he who bars the gate!','',52826,0,0,0,64,0,0,24445,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Fool mortals. Hurl yourselves into your own demise.','',52827,0,0,0,64,0,0,24446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('By the Firelord\'s command, you, too, shall perish!','',52828,0,0,0,64,0,0,24447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
