('Yours is a path of doom.','',52836,0,0,0,65,0,0,24509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Destroy their camp. Burn their tree to ash.','',52837,0,0,0,65,0,0,24508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
