('Our ethereal technomancy has the ability to modify an item\'s arcane essence in ways previously unimaginable. We can also house items in a pocket dimension... for a small fee. See my associates for details.$B$BUnless you have something for me to examine?','Our ethereal technomancy has the ability to modify an item\'s arcane essence in ways previously unimaginable. We can also house items in a pocket dimension... for a small fee. See my associates for details.$B$BUnless you have something for me to examine?',53018,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,396,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Unsatisfied with the appearance of an item?$B$BBehold the Transmogrifier, one of our most potent technomantic engines. With it, a skilled Warpweaver may shift the appearance of one object to that of another.$B$BWhat might this humble one transmogrify for you, goodly customer?','Unsatisfied with the appearance of an item?$B$BBehold the Transmogrifier, one of our most potent technomantic engines. With it, a skilled Warpweaver may shift the appearance of one object to that of another.$B$BWhat might this humble one transmogrify for you, goodly customer?',53019,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,396,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
