('After inspecting the statues, we saw this old lady pandaren come out of the house.','',54311,0,0,1,64,0,0,31064,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Be on the lookout for Alliance.','',54312,0,0,1,64,0,0,31158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Come on, Kiryn. Let\'s go do girl stuff.',54313,0,0,1,64,0,0,0,31532,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('We will investigate this hut. Perhaps they have seen Alliance survivors.','',54314,0,0,1,64,0,0,31159,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Yeah, the hut! Good idea. You go first.','',54315,0,0,1,64,0,0,31058,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('\"Stay out - no visitors.\" Hah!','',54316,0,0,1,64,0,0,31160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Hey Gorrok, which girl do you like? Shokia or Kiryn?','',54317,0,0,1,64,0,0,31061,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
