('','I sense a great disturbance in the balance approaching. The chaos of it burns my mind!',55321,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,26148,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Mere whelps, experiments, a means to a greater end. You will see what the research of my clutch has yielded.','',55322,0,0,0,65,0,0,26362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('For this moment ALONE was I made. Look upon your death, mortals, and despair!','',55323,0,0,0,65,0,0,26318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
