('','Take heart, heroes, life will always blossom from the darkest soil!',55325,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,26506,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','In dreams, we may overcome any obstacle!',55326,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,26149,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Winds of the arcane be at their backs, and refresh them in this hour of darkness!','',55327,0,0,0,65,0,0,26267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('The cycle of time brings an end to all things.','',55328,0,0,0,65,0,0,25954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
