('$p! Check this thing out!','',55548,0,0,5,64,0,0,27295,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','We\'re ready to go whenever you are, $n.',55549,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27428,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I am in pain, but it warms my heart that Liu Lang\'s grandchildren have not forgotten me.','',55550,0,0,0,64,0,0,27822,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Hop in.',55551,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27429,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
