('','Don\'t listen to him.  We\'ve got work to do.',55553,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27430,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('$p, where\'s Master Shang?','',55554,0,0,6,64,0,0,27297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','...Ji, they were in the Wood of Staves.  You know where Master Shang is now.',55555,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27431,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Bah, let a pandaren hope, would you?  I\'m going to miss the old man.','',55556,0,0,1,64,0,0,27298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Hey! Look at that waterfall!',55557,0,0,25,65,0,0,0,30421,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','I wonder if there\'s a cave behind it.',55558,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,30422,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','You should always check behind waterfalls for caves.',55559,0,0,25,65,0,0,0,30423,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Ji, be respectful when we speak to Shen-zin Su.',55560,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27432,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('When am I not respectful?  You hurt me, Aysa.','',55561,0,0,6,64,0,0,27299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','I might if you embarrass us.',55562,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27433,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Shen-zin Su, we are the descendants of Liu Lang.  We\'ve sensed your pain, and we want to help.',55563,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27434,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','What ails you Shen-zin Su?  What can we do?',55564,0,0,6,65,0,0,0,27435,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Check out all the cool silk!',55565,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,30424,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Do you think that they really get this stuff from the silkworms\' rear end?',55566,0,0,6,65,0,0,0,30429,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Eww... they look like maggots.',55567,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,30441,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('There is a thorn in my side.  I cannot remove it.','',55568,0,0,0,64,0,0,27823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
