('','We will find it, and we will remove it.  You have our word!',55573,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27437,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('A thorn?  And I left my tweezers at home.','',55574,0,0,6,64,0,0,27300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('How could such a thing cause pain to something so large?','',55575,0,0,6,64,0,0,27301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','We\'ll know soon enough.',55576,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27438,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Are you seeing what I\'m seeing?!  Is that a boat?!','',55577,0,0,5,64,0,0,27302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','It is a boat... a whole airship!  That\'s a bigger thorn than I was expecting.',55578,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27439,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
