('It looks like they crashed.  I don\'t think they\'re here for trouble.','',55580,0,0,1,64,0,0,27304,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Someone has crashed into our island.  Removing this thorn may be more complicated than we thought.',55581,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27440,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','We should let Elder Shaopai know and then plan our next move.',55582,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,27441,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Look at this!',55583,0,0,25,65,0,0,0,30442,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','There\'s a village up here... and a big fish statue, too.',55584,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,30443,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','You think the jinyu built this place?',55585,0,0,6,65,0,0,0,30444,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
