('','Leave this place.',55907,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,27609,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','The haze has been lifted from my eyes... forgive me for doubting you...',55908,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,27604,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Be free of doubt, priestess...','Be free of doubt, priestess...',55909,0,0,0,64,0,0,28559,28559,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','My noble Varo\'then, do return and dispose of this murderous band.',55910,0,0,25,64,0,0,0,26019,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('At your side, my queen!','',55912,0,0,0,65,0,0,26136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','It is them!',55913,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,26030,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Heroes! We have been sent by Nozdormu! Quickly, on our backs, we must get you to the Dragon Soul!',55914,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,26032,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
