('','The link to the portal must be broken! Quickly, to Stormrage!',55918,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,26036,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Ah, welcome. You are here to join us in the coming celebration? No? A pity.',55919,0,0,274,64,0,0,0,26013,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Serve Azshara, puppets, and rejoice.',55920,0,0,273,64,0,0,0,26026,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
