('Crap!','',57591,0,0,0,64,0,0,31000,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Looks like he\'s got a little bit o\' that water stuck in his gills. I\'ll just scoop some of this up...','',57592,0,0,0,64,0,0,30996,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I\'ll just scrape some of this water from his little spider mouth-parts. A little bit o\' poison never hurt no one, right?','',57593,0,0,0,64,0,0,30999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
