('Ah, fresh meat for the dogs.','',58608,0,0,0,64,0,0,27550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','I\'ve got backup. Watch this.',58609,0,0,397,64,0,0,0,31180,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('$n, over here.','',58610,0,15495,0,64,0,0,32443,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('We must gain a foothold here.. away from these Horde dogs.','',58611,0,15496,0,64,0,0,32444,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I grow weary of these Horde cowards. There must be someplace else in this village to rest.','',58612,0,15496,0,64,0,0,32445,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('These people shall not be enslaved by your cruel Horde. I will not allow it!','',58613,0,15496,0,64,0,0,32446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('How many innocents have died at your hand, orc? Your Horde has no honor...','',58614,0,15496,0,64,0,0,32447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Only three Horde rats left. Shouldn\'t be a problem to finish you off once and for all.','',58615,0,15496,0,64,0,0,32448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
