('','We\'ll cover this front. You keep my priests safe.',59720,0,0,396,65,0,0,0,27503,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Hold the line, sailors! Your brothers depend on you!',59721,0,18357,22,65,0,0,0,27505,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Tend to the wounded! This isn\'t over yet.',59722,0,18358,22,65,0,0,0,27506,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
