('We were.  My new friend here performed stunningly!','',61928,0,0,1,64,0,0,29852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Yes.  We\'ll need his expertise with a crossbow when the final battle comes.','',61929,0,0,1,64,0,0,28429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Good to see you well, Rensai. We\'re here for Hawkmaster Nurong. Where can we find him?','',61931,0,0,1,64,0,0,28424,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
