('Her happiness is our reward, her sorrow our failure.','',62456,0,0,0,64,0,0,29307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('We will give our lives for the Empress without hesitation. She is the light, and without Her our lives will be lost to darkness.','',62457,0,0,0,64,0,0,29308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('The chaff of the world tumbles across our doorstep, driven by fear; Her royal storm will whisk them away.','',62458,0,0,0,64,0,0,29312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('They are but the waves crashing upon the mountain of Her divine will. They may rise again and again; but will accomplish nothing.','',62459,0,0,0,64,0,0,29314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
