('Behold the voice of Her divine wrath.','',62469,0,0,0,64,0,0,29320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Our voice gives form to Her will.','',62470,0,0,0,64,0,0,29323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Her will is greater than us all. You will join us or you will perish.','',62471,0,0,0,64,0,0,29322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Her gifts are many, our gratitude immeasurable.','',62472,0,0,0,64,0,0,29309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
