('I...I see everything clearly now.','',66009,0,0,2,64,0,0,30190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('The Titans! It would seem the mogu salvaged and repurposed ancient Titan technology to advance their empire!','',66010,0,0,5,64,0,0,30191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
