('Oh, ho! Oh ho ho.$B$BYo ho ho, even.$B$BI just come back from the land of Pandaria, with its rolling hills and harsh mountains, and the strangest rum I ever tasted.  I crashed me ship into the Jade Forest and me cargo made the land uninhabitable, but in the meantime I can take ye to the Valley of the Four Winds, lickey-split.$B$BDo yeh trust me, $c?','',66602,0,0,0,64,0,0,7394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Yarrrr, yeh don\'t want none of what I be dealin\', $gSonny:missy;.$B$BBegone wit\' yeh!','',66603,0,0,0,64,0,0,7394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
