('You again. Do you see it now? Alliance arrogance!','',67754,0,0,1,64,0,0,32509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('My people have stood tall without you for thousands of years.','',67755,0,0,25,64,0,0,32572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
