('Welcome, weaklings, to the rebirth of the Zandalari Empire!','Welcome, weaklings, to the rebirth of the Zandalari Empire!',71613,0,0,0,64,0,0,36009,36009,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('The tribes have assembled - ye face not one force, but the combined might of all of the troll empire! The hand of Zul will span all the continents of Azeroth once again! An ye lesser races will know pain!','The tribes have assembled - ye face not one force, but the combined might of all of the troll empire! The hand of Zul will span all the continents of Azeroth once again! An ye lesser races will know pain!',71614,0,0,0,64,0,0,36010,36010,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
