('','Up here, champion!',71646,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35358,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','The Sunreavers have devised a way to ward our flying mounts against the lightning. But fly in loose formation, just in case.',71647,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35359,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Look below! Our continued assaults on the town and crypts have thrown the enemy into disarray. The mogu and the Zandalari already fear the might of the Horde.',71648,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35360,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
