('','The other rangers are waiting for us just ahead. Our first priority is - Look out!',71650,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35362,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','By the sunwell! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!',71651,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35363,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Down! Everyone, down!',71652,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35364,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Champion, are you all right?',71653,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35365,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
