('','They are pulling back, but we cannot let up now.',71656,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35368,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Our only hope of getting out of here alive is to take the town.',71657,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,35369,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
