('You! You have earned my ire. I will make an example of you, such that all who look upon my might will tremble and submit.','',72509,0,0,0,64,0,0,35589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('I am Lei Shen, slayer of kings and gods. You have made a grave mistake.','',72510,0,0,0,64,0,0,35581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
