('','Sorry, $c. I got nothin\' for ya.',73273,0,0,0,65,0,0,0,0,18,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Filthy monsters! I owe ye me life.','',73274,0,0,4,64,0,0,37294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
