('To do what is right, no matter the cost. That is wisdom.','',73746,0,0,1,70,0,0,37450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('When is it ever wise not to act for the greater good?','',73747,0,0,1,70,0,0,37451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Ah, the dragon child and the hero. Together you will achieve great things.',73748,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37364,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Tell me, dragon child: What is the nature of wisdom?',73749,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37365,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Spoken like a true child of the Aspects. Always seeking to change the world.',73750,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37366,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','But true wisdom comes from KNOWING what is right. And sometimes, DOING nothing at all.',73751,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37367,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','To learn THAT is to learn true wisdom.',73752,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37368,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','Come forward! I will give you my blessing.',73753,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37369,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','My challenge, if you accept it, will test your cunning and footwork even in the midst of life-threatening danger.',73754,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37524,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
