('','Seek out your true enemy! Do not be fooled by his false images!',73880,0,0,2,65,0,0,0,37363,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('','The elements are undying! Make use of your time before they rise again!',73881,0,0,1,65,0,0,0,37359,0,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
