('<Vol\'jin sees his opportunity slipping away. He holds up his hands.>$b$bWait now, $r! Orgrimmar be a fortress. My people, we ain\'t gonna crack dat nut on our own. How long we gonna last out here? Days? Weeks? Vol\'jin can\'t say.$b$bYou keep da supplies comin\', an\' I promise, more Kor\'kron gonna die. Before ya troops even land! The blood bein\' spilt ain\'t even ya own! Surely dat be worth a few crates of meat?','',74254,0,0,0,64,0,0,0,0,274,5,1,0,0,0,54630),
