('We do not know! That is precisely why I am here.','',75180,0,0,5,64,0,0,38868,0,1,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
('Time is frozen in this place. The island teems with life, yet somehow never changes.','',75181,0,0,1,64,0,0,38869,0,1,0,0,0,0,0,54630),
